{
 "id": "seg5",
 "title": "攻击者能做什么",
 "pill": 5,
 "total": 163.76,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5-00",
   "text": "入口这么多，怎么系统地去想？办法是威胁建模。",
   "spoken": "入口这么多，怎么系统的去想？办法是威胁建模。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg5-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 5.712,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 6.457
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-01",
   "text": "威胁建模，就是在写代码之前，列出攻击者能控制的输入、能触发的路径、想得到的结果。",
   "spoken": "威胁建模，就是在写代码之前，列出攻击者能控制的输入、能触发的路径、想得到的结果。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg5-01.mp3",
   "start": 7.532,
   "dur": 7.776,
   "speechStart": 7.63,
   "speechEnd": 14.475
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-02",
   "text": "核心只有一个问题：攻击者能控制什么？",
   "spoken": "核心只有一个问题：攻击者能控制什么？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg5-02.mp3",
   "start": 15.528,
   "dur": 3.792,
   "speechStart": 15.626,
   "speechEnd": 18.471
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-03",
   "text": "对任何合约，都先默认攻击者能做到这些事。",
   "spoken": "对任何合约，都先默认攻击者能做到这些事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg5-03.mp3",
   "start": 19.82,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 19.918,
   "speechEnd": 23.31
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-04",
   "text": "用任意参数，调用任意一个公开函数。",
   "spoken": "用任意参数，掉用任意一个公开函数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg5-04.mp3",
   "start": 24.36,
   "dur": 4.032,
   "speechStart": 24.458,
   "speechEnd": 27.541
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-05",
   "text": "部署自己的合约，让你的合约去调用它，比如恶意代币、恶意回调。",
   "spoken": "部署自己的合约，让你的合约去掉用它，比如恶意代币、恶意回掉。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg5-05.mp3",
   "start": 28.612,
   "dur": 5.856,
   "speechStart": 28.71,
   "speechEnd": 33.626
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-06",
   "text": "在一笔交易里，借到巨额资金。",
   "spoken": "在一笔交易里，借到巨额资金。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg5-06.mp3",
   "start": 34.688,
   "dur": 3.336,
   "speechStart": 34.786,
   "speechEnd": 37.19
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-07",
   "text": "看到内存池里还没确认的交易，在它前后插入自己的交易。",
   "spoken": "看到内存池里还没确认的交易，在它前后插入自己的交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg5-07.mp3",
   "start": 38.244,
   "dur": 5.184,
   "speechStart": 38.342,
   "speechEnd": 42.592
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-08",
   "text": "不经过你的函数，直接往你的合约里转入代币。",
   "spoken": "不经过你的函数，直接往你的合约里转入代币。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg5-08.mp3",
   "start": 43.648,
   "dur": 4.392,
   "speechStart": 43.746,
   "speechEnd": 47.21
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-09",
   "text": "读取你合约的全部存储，包括标成 private 的变量。",
   "spoken": "读取你合约的全部存储，包括标成 private 的变量。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg5-09.mp3",
   "start": 48.26,
   "dur": 4.296,
   "speechStart": 48.358,
   "speechEnd": 51.715
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-10",
   "text": "在另一条链或另一个合约上，重放你签过的消息。",
   "spoken": "在另一条链或另一个合约上，虫放你签过的消息。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg5-10.mp3",
   "start": 52.776,
   "dur": 4.248,
   "speechStart": 52.874,
   "speechEnd": 56.171
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-11",
   "text": "举个例子。管理员密码存在 private 变量里，攻击者读得到吗？",
   "spoken": "举个例子。管理员密码存在 private 变量里，攻击者读得到吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg5-11.mp3",
   "start": 57.244,
   "dur": 5.856,
   "speechStart": 57.342,
   "speechEnd": 62.292
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-12",
   "text": "读得到。private 只限制别的合约来调用这个变量，不隐藏链上数据。",
   "spoken": "读得到。private 只限制别的合约来掉用这个变量，不隐藏链上数据。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg5-12.mp3",
   "start": 63.6,
   "dur": 6.168,
   "speechStart": 63.698,
   "speechEnd": 68.933
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-13",
   "text": "反过来，攻击者通常做不到三件事。",
   "spoken": "反过来，攻击者通常做不到三件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg5-13.mp3",
   "start": 69.988,
   "dur": 3.816,
   "speechStart": 70.086,
   "speechEnd": 72.967
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-14",
   "text": "伪造别人的签名，除非私钥泄露，或者验签写错了。",
   "spoken": "伪造别人的签名，除非私钥泄漏，或者验签写错了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg5-14.mp3",
   "start": 74.024,
   "dur": 4.704,
   "speechStart": 74.122,
   "speechEnd": 77.907
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-15",
   "text": "修改已经确认的区块，除非链的共识被攻破。",
   "spoken": "修改已经确认的区块，除非链的共识被攻破。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg5-15.mp3",
   "start": 78.948,
   "dur": 4.2,
   "speechStart": 79.046,
   "speechEnd": 82.296
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-16",
   "text": "让合约以为调用者是别人，除非你的代码用错了身份判断的方式。",
   "spoken": "让合约以为掉用者是别人，除非你的代码用错了身份判断的方式。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg5-16.mp3",
   "start": 83.368,
   "dur": 5.736,
   "speechStart": 83.466,
   "speechEnd": 88.263
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-17",
   "text": "有了这张能力清单，建模分六步。",
   "spoken": "有了这张能力清单，建模分六步。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg5-17.mp3",
   "start": 89.324,
   "dur": 3.528,
   "speechStart": 89.422,
   "speechEnd": 92.029
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-18",
   "text": "第一，列出合约持有的资产，比如用户存进来的 USDT、协议手续费。",
   "spoken": "第一，列出合约持有的资产，比如用户存进来的 USDT、协议手续费。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg5-18.mp3",
   "start": 93.072,
   "dur": 6.816,
   "speechStart": 93.17,
   "speechEnd": 99.039
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-19",
   "text": "第二，列出每个会改变资产的函数，标上谁能调用。",
   "spoken": "第二，列出每个会改变资产的函数，标上谁能掉用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg5-19.mp3",
   "start": 100.108,
   "dur": 5.208,
   "speechStart": 100.206,
   "speechEnd": 104.479
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-20",
   "text": "第三，写出不变量，也就是任何操作之后，都必须成立的式子。",
   "spoken": "第三，写出不变量，也就是任何操作之后，都必须成立的式子。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg5-20.mp3",
   "start": 105.536,
   "dur": 5.952,
   "speechStart": 105.634,
   "speechEnd": 110.657
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-21",
   "text": "比如，合约里的 USDT 余额，不少于所有用户存款之和。",
   "spoken": "比如，合约里的 USDT 余额，不少于所有用户存款之和。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg5-21.mp3",
   "start": 111.708,
   "dur": 5.544,
   "speechStart": 111.806,
   "speechEnd": 116.425
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-22",
   "text": "第四，对每个函数问：攻击者控制哪些输入？有哪些外部调用？调用之前，状态更新了没有？",
   "spoken": "第四，对每个函数问：攻击者控制哪些输入？有哪些外部掉用？掉用之前，状态更新了没有？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg5-22.mp3",
   "start": 117.472,
   "dur": 9.144,
   "speechStart": 117.57,
   "speechEnd": 125.77
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-23",
   "text": "第五，对每个外部数据问：价格、余额、签名从哪里来？一笔交易里能不能被操纵？",
   "spoken": "第五，对每个外部数据问：价格、余额、签名从哪里来？一笔交易里能不能被操纵？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg5-23.mp3",
   "start": 127.116,
   "dur": 8.904,
   "speechStart": 127.214,
   "speechEnd": 135.211
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-24",
   "text": "第六，对每个特权角色问：私钥在谁手里？被盗了最多损失多少？有没有时间锁？",
   "spoken": "第六，对每个特权决色问：私钥在谁手里？被盗了最多损失多少？有没有时间锁？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg5-24.mp3",
   "start": 136.52,
   "dur": 8.184,
   "speechStart": 136.618,
   "speechEnd": 143.865
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-25",
   "text": "不变量是整个安全工作的锚点。所有测试，最后都在验证它。",
   "spoken": "不变量是整个安全工作的锚点。所有测试，最后都在验证它。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg5-25.mp3",
   "start": 145.204,
   "dur": 5.784,
   "speechStart": 145.302,
   "speechEnd": 150.168
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-26",
   "text": "这个方法也有局限。威胁建模靠人的想象力。",
   "spoken": "这个方法也有局限。威胁建模靠人的想象力。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg5-26.mp3",
   "start": 151.208,
   "dur": 4.68,
   "speechStart": 151.306,
   "speechEnd": 155.053
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-27",
   "text": "经济攻击常常超出单个合约，要把整个协议和外部市场放在一起建模。",
   "spoken": "经济攻击常常超出单个合约，要把整个协议和外部市场放在一起建模。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg5-27.mp3",
